<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Lanes year net profit down 33.5 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Lanes year net profit down 33.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>		  (A$ million unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 5.32 vs 8.00</p>
<p>    Net profit				 2.74 vs 6.26</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		 6.00 vs 10.00</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		10.00 vs 17.00</p>
<p>    Sales				    230.17 vs 221.91</p>
<p>    Other income			     8.00 vs 9.49</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				12.8 vs 30.20</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		    0.56 loss vs 0.26 gain</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date October 31</p>
<p>Reg date October 18</p>
<p>    Tax					  2.03 vs 2.00</p>
<p>    Interest				   1.98 vs 1.54</p>
<p>    Depreciation			     5.83 vs 5.05</p>
<p>    Minorities				  nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Lanes sells and services motor vehicles and related parts. -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
